cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you use hardnormly in your research, please cite this software using the metadata below.'
type: software
title: hardnormly
abstract: >-
  hardnormly is a VCF normalization and hard filtering toolkit for whole-exome
  sequencing variant processing. It normalizes variants through multiallelic
  splitting and left-alignment, annotates genomic regions, and applies caller-specific
  hard filters through a standalone command-line tool and a Snakemake workflow.
version: 0.7.4
date-released: '2026-02-19'
